OL,3,AVictims in rape cases must not feel
OL,4,Alike they are on trial, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government needs to "constantly
OL,7,Flook" at how rape trials are conducted
OL,8,Fto better support alleged victims in
OL,9,Fcourt, the prime minister told Times
OL,10,FRadio, although BBC News understands
OL,11,Fthere are no plans to change the law
OL,12,Faround rape trials.
OL,14,FActor and comedian Brand was found
OL,15,Fguilty of one count of rape and three
OL,16,Fcounts of sexual assault after a
OL,17,Ffour-week trial in London.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
